hadiths[578]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4448","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yateem ki kafalat karne wala us ka ho ya ghair ka, main aur wo jannat mein in donon ki tarah honge."
"4449","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajr-e-Aswad barf se zyada safed tha yahan tak ke usay Bani Adam ki khataon ne siyah kar diya."
"4450","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum se pehle aik shakhs pakra jata to us ke liye zameen mein garha khoda jata aur use us mein dala jata; phir aara laaya jata aur us ke sar par rakha jata aur do tukre kar diya jata; ye use us ke deen se nahi rokta tha. Aur lohe ki kanghiyon se us ke gosht ke neeche haddi ya rag se nochha jata; ye use us ke deen se nahi rokta tha. Allah ki qasam, Allah is muamle ko zaroor poora karega yahan tak ke sawaar Sana se Hazramaut tak chalega aur Allah ke siwa kisi se nahi darega, aur bheriya us ki bakriyon par hoga; lekin tum jaldi karte ho."
"4451","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mehman ki sab se pehle mezbani karne wale Ibrahim thay."
"4452","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ahle jahiliyyat kehte thay ke bad-shaguni sirf aurat, janwar aur ghar mein hai."
"4453","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dawood insaanon mein sab se zyada ibadat-guzar thay."
"4454","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik shakhs logon ko qarz deta tha; wo apne khadim se kehta tha: Jab tum tang-dast ke paas aao to us se darguzar karo, shayad Allah ham se darguzar kare. Phir wo Allah se mila to us ne us se darguzar kiya."
"4455","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bani Israel mein do shakhs thay jo aapas mein bhai bane hue thay; un mein se aik gunahgar tha aur doosra ibadat mein koshish karne wala. Koshish karne wala hamesha doosre ko gunah par dekhta to kehta: Baaz aa. Phir us ne use aik din gunah par paya to us se kaha: Baaz aa. To us ne kaha: Mujhe mere Rab ke saath chhor de; kiya tum mujh par nigehban bana kar bheje gaye ho? To us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Allah tumhein nahi bakhshega ya Allah tumhein jannat mein dakhil nahi karega. Phir un donon ki rooh qabz ki gayi aur wo donon Rabbul Aalamin ke paas jama hue. To us ne is koshish karne wale se farmaya: Kiya tum mujh se zyada jaanne wale thay ya mere haath mein jo hai us par qaadir thay? Aur gunahgar se farmaya: Jao aur meri rehmat se jannat mein dakhil ho jao. Aur doosre ke baare mein farmaya: Use aag ki taraf le jao."
"4456","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zakariya barhayi thay."
"4457","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ashura aik din tha jis ka roza ahle jahiliyyat rakhte thay; pas tum mein se jo chahe us ka roza rakhe aur jo na-pasand kare wo chhor de."
"4458","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raaste mein darakht ki aik daali thi jo logon ko takleef deti thi; to aik shakhs ne use hata diya aur jannat mein dakhil kiya gaya."
"4459","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bani Israel mein aik shakhs tha jis ne ninyanwe insaan qatl kiye thay; phir wo sawal karne nikla aur aik rahib ke paas aaya aur us se pucha aur us se kaha: Kiya mere liye tauba hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi. To us ne use qatl kar diya. Phir wo sawal karta raha; phir us se aik shakhs ne kaha: Falan falan basti mein jao. Phir use maut ne pa liya to us ne apna seena us ki taraf jhuka diya. Phir us ke baare mein rehmat ke farishte aur azaab ke farishte jhagde. To Allah ne is se wahi ki ke qareeb ho aur is se wahi ki ke door ho. Aur farmaya: Donon ke darmiyan naapo. To unhon ne use is ki taraf baalisht qareeb paya to use bakhsh diya gaya."
"4460","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare liye do din thay jin mein tum khelte thay; Allah ne tumhein un ke badle un se behtar diya hai: Fitr ka din aur Azha ka din."
"4461","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum se pehle logon mein aik badshah tha aur us ke paas jaadugar tha; phir jab wo burha ho gaya to us ne badshah se kaha: Main burha ho gaya hun; pas mere paas aik ladka bhejo jise main jadu sikhaun. To us ne us ke paas aik ladka bheja jise wo sikhata tha. Us ke raaste mein jab wo chalta to aik rahib tha; wo us ke paas baithta aur us ki baat sunta to use pasand aati. Phir jab wo jaadugar ke paas aata to rahib ke paas se guzarta aur us ke paas baithta; phir jab jaadugar ke paas aata to wo use marta. To us ne is ki shikayat rahib se ki to us ne kaha: Jab tum jaadugar ke paas aao to kaho: Mere ghar walon ne mujhe rok liya; aur jab apne ghar walon ke paas aao to kaho: Jaadugar ne mujhe rok liya. Phir jab wo isi haal mein tha ke wo aik azeem janwar par aaya jis ne logon ko rok rakha tha. To us ne kaha: Aaj main janunga ke jaadugar afzal hai ya rahib? Phir us ne pathar liya aur kaha: Ae Allah, agar rahib ka muamla tere nazdeek jaadugar ke muamle se zyada mehboob hai to is janwar ko maar de taake log guzar jayen. Phir us ne use mara aur use maar diya aur log guzar gaye. Phir wo rahib ke paas aaya aur use khabar di to rahib ne us se kaha: Ae bete, aaj tum mujh se behtar ho; tumhara muamla wahan pahunch chuka hai jo main dekhta hun; aur beshak tum aazmaye jaoge, pas meri taraf rehnumayi na karna. Aur ladka paidaishi andhe aur kodhi ko achcha karta aur logon ka har beemari se ilaaj karta tha. To badshah ke aik humnasheen ne suna jo andha ho chuka tha; phir wo us ke paas bahut se tohfe lekar aaya aur kaha: Ye sab kuch jo yahan hai tumhare liye hai agar tum mujhe shifa do. Us ne kaha: Main kisi ko shifa nahi deta; shifa to Allah azza wa jal deta hai. Phir agar tum Allah par iman lao to main Allah se dua karunga aur wo tumhein shifa dega. Phir wo Allah par iman laya to Allah ne use shifa di. Phir wo badshah ke paas aaya aur us ke paas baitha jaisa wo baithta tha. To badshah ne us se kaha: Kis ne tumhari beenayi lautayi? Us ne kaha: Mere Rab ne. Us ne kaha: Aur mere siwa tumhara Rab hai? Us ne kaha: Mera aur tumhara Rab Allah hai. To us ne use pakra aur use azaab deta raha yahan tak ke us ne ladke ki taraf rehnumayi ki. Phir ladke ko laya gaya to badshah ne us se kaha: Ae bete, tumhara jadu wahan pahunch chuka hai jo paidaishi andhe aur kodhi ko achcha karta hai aur tum karte ho aur karte ho! To us ne kaha: Main kisi ko shifa nahi deta; shifa to Allah azza wa jal deta hai. To us ne use pakra aur use azaab deta raha yahan tak ke us ne rahib ki taraf rehnumayi ki. Phir rahib ko laya gaya aur us se kaha gaya: Apne deen se laut aao; to us ne inkar kar diya. Phir us ne aara mangwaya aur aara us ke sar ki maang par rakha aur use us se cheer diya yahan tak ke us ke do tukre gir pade. Phir badshah ke humnasheen ko laya gaya aur us se kaha gaya: Apne deen se laut aao; to us ne inkar kar diya. Phir us ke sar ki maang mein aara rakha aur use cheer diya yahan tak ke us ke do tukre gir pade. Phir ladke ko laya gaya aur us se kaha gaya: Apne deen se laut aao; to us ne inkar kar diya. Phir us ne use apne saathiyon mein se kuch ko diya aur kaha: Use falan falan pahar par le jao aur use pahar par charhao; phir jab use us ki choti par pahunchao to agar wo apne deen se laut aaye warna use phenk do. Phir wo use le gaye aur use pahar par charhaya. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah, mujhe jis tarah chahe un se kafi ho ja. To pahar un sameet hil gaya aur wo gir pade; aur wo chalta hua badshah ke paas aaya. To badshah ne us se kaha: Tumhare saathiyon ka kiya bana? Us ne kaha: Allah mujhe un se kafi ho gaya. Phir us ne use apne saathiyon mein se kuch ko diya aur kaha: Use le jao aur use kashti mein sawaar karo aur us ke saath samundar ke darmiyan jao; phir agar wo apne deen se laut aaye warna use phenk do. Phir wo use le gaye. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah, mujhe jis tarah chahe un se kafi ho ja. To kashti un sameet ulat gayi aur wo doob gaye; aur wo chalta hua badshah ke paas aaya. To badshah ne us se kaha: Tumhare saathiyon ka kiya bana? Us ne kaha: Allah mujhe un se kafi ho gaya. Phir us ne badshah se kaha: Tum mujhe qatl nahi kar sakte yahan tak ke wo karo jo main tumhein hukm dun! Us ne kaha: Wo kiya hai? Us ne kaha: Logon ko aik khule maidan mein jama karo aur mujhe tane par suli do; phir meri tarkash mein se teer lo, phir teer ko kaman ke darmiyan rakho, phir kaho: Ladke ke Rab Allah ke naam se, phir phenko; kyunke jab tum aisa karoge to mujhe qatl karoge. Phir us ne logon ko aik khule maidan mein jama kiya aur use tane par suli di; phir us ki tarkash mein se teer liya, phir teer ko kaman ke darmiyan rakha, phir kaha: Ladke ke Rab Allah ke naam se, phir use phenka. To teer us ki kanpati mein laga; phir us ne apna haath apni kanpati mein teer ki jagah par rakha aur mar gaya. To logon ne kaha: Ham ladke ke Rab par iman laye, ham ladke ke Rab par iman laye, ham ladke ke Rab par iman laye. Phir badshah ke paas aaya gaya aur us se kaha gaya: Jis se tum darte thay kiya tum ne dekha? Allah ki qasam tumhara darr tum par utar pada hai; log iman le aaye hain! Phir us ne galiyon ke muhano par khandaqon ka hukm diya to khodi gayin aur aag bharhkayi gayin; aur kaha: Jo apne deen se na laute use us mein phenk do. Phir unhon ne aisa kiya yahan tak ke aik aurat aayi jis ke saath us ka bachcha tha; wo us mein padne se ruki to ladke ne us se kaha: Ae maan, sabr kar, kyunke tum haq par ho."
"4462","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nabiyon mein se aik Nabi lakeer kheenchta tha; phir jo us ki lakeer se muwafiq ho wo durust hai."
"4463","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye muamla Himyar mein tha; phir Allah ne use un se nikaal liya aur Quraish mein kar diya; aur wo un ki taraf lautega."
"4464","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bani Israel mein se aik aurat thi jo chhote qad ki thi jo do lambi auraton ke saath chalti thi; phir us ne lakri ke do pair banaye aur sone ki angoothi jo mitti se dhaki hui thi, phir use mushk se bhar diya jo sab se umda khushbu hai. Phir wo donon auraton ke darmiyan se guzri aur unhon ne use na pehchana; phir us ne apne haath se aise kaha."
"4465","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do auratein thin jin ke saath un ke do bete thay; bheriya aaya aur un mein se aik ke bete ko le gaya. To us ki saathi ne kaha: Wo tumhare bete ko le gaya; aur doosri ne kaha: Wo tumhare bete ko le gaya! Phir unhon ne Dawood se faisla chaha to unhon ne bari ke haq mein faisla kiya. Phir wo donon Sulaiman bin Dawood ke paas se niklein aur unhein is ki khabar di. To unhon ne kaha: Mere paas chhuri lao, use un donon ke darmiyan cheerta hun. To chhoti ne kaha: Aisa na karo, Allah tum par rehem kare; wo us ka beta hai. To unhon ne chhoti ke haq mein faisla kiya."
"4466","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bani Israel ki siyasat Nabi karte thay; jab bhi koi Nabi halak hota to Nabi us ka janashin hota; aur beshak mere baad koi Nabi nahi; aur khalifa honge aur bahut honge. Sahaba ne kaha: Phir tum hamein kiya hukm dete ho? Farmaya: Pehle ki baiat poori karo, pehle ki; aur unhein un ka haq do jo Allah ne un ke liye banaya hai; kyunke Allah un se sawal karega jis ki unhein nigehbani di gayi."
"4467","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bani Israel nange ghusl karte thay aur un mein se baaz baaz ko dekhte thay; aur Musa alaihis salam akele ghusl karte thay. To unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Musa ko hamare saath ghusl karne se sirf ye rokta hai ke wo khusya-bara hain. Phir wo aik baar ghusl karne gaye aur apna kapra pathar par rakha to pathar un ka kapra lekar bhaag gaya. To Musa us ke peeche daudte hue kehte thay: Mera kapra ae pathar, mera kapra ae pathar. Yahan tak ke Bani Israel ne Musa ko dekh liya to unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Musa mein koi aeb nahi. Aur unhon ne apna kapra liya aur pathar ko maarne lage."
"4468","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Goya main Musa ko is wadi mein dekh raha hun jo do chadaron ke darmiyan ehram bandhe hue hain."
"4469","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Goya main use dekh raha hun jo siyah khule pairon wala hai jo use eent eent kar ke ukhaarta hai, yani Kaaba."
"4470","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Goya main Yunus ko oontni par dekh raha hun jis ki nakeel chhaal ki hai aur un par oon ka jubba hai aur wo keh rahe hain: Labbaik Ae Allah Labbaik."
"4471","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bara bara."
"4472","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki kitab qisas hai."
"4473","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki kitab Allah ki rassi hai jo aasman se zameen tak phaili hui hai."
"4474","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne makhlooq ki taqdeerein aasmanon aur zameen ko paida karne se pachaas hazaar saal pehle likh dein aur us ka Arsh pani par tha."
"4475","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare Rab ne makhlooq ko paida karne se pehle apne upar apne haath se likh diya: Meri rehmat mere ghusse par sabqat le gayi."
"4476","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam par zina ka us ka hissa likh diya gaya hai jo use zaroor payega; pas dono aankhon ka zina dekhna hai, dono kaanon ka zina sunna hai, zaban ka zina baat hai, haath ka zina pakarna hai, pair ka zina chalna hai aur dil khwahish karta hai aur tamanna karta hai; aur sharmgah us ki tasdeeq karti hai ya takzeeb."
"4477","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khakh khakh, use phenk do; kiya tum nahi jante ke ham sadqa nahi khate?"
"4478","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Murde ki haddi torna us ke zinda torne ki tarah hai."
"4479","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gunah ke liye kafi hai ke jis ki roti tumhare haath mein ho use rok lo."
"4480","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ke liye gunah ke liye kafi hai ke wo har wo baat bayan kare jo sune."
"4481","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ke liye gunah ke liye kafi hai ke jis ko roti de use zaya kare."
"4482","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ke liye jhoot ke liye kafi hai ke wo har wo baat bayan kare jo sune."
"4483","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke sar par talwaron ki chamak us ke fitne ke liye kafi hai."
"4484","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saanp ke liye korhe ki aik maar kafi hai, chahe use lage ya khata jaye."
"4485","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nasab se bezaari Allah se kufr hai agarche bareek ho."
"4486","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ke liye kufr hai ke wo aise nasab ka dawa kare jo maloom na ho ya us ka inkar kare agarche bareek ho."
"4487","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Majlis ka kaffara ye hai ke banda kahe: Paak hai tu Ae Allah aur teri hamd ke saath; main gawahi deta hun ke tere siwa koi mabood nahi, tu tanha hai tera koi shareek nahi; main tujh se bakhshish mangta hun aur teri taraf tauba karta hun."
"4488","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mannat ka kaffara jab naam na liya gaya ho qasam ka kaffara hai."
"4489","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khataon ke kaffare: na-pasandeeda haalaton mein wuzu mukammal karna, masjdon ki taraf qadam chalana aur namaz ke baad namaz ka intezar karna."
"4490","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apna shar logon se roko; kyunke wo tumhari taraf se tum par sadqa hai."
"4491","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ham se apni dakaar roko; kyunke duniya mein sab se zyada pait bharne wale qayamat ke din sab se zyada bhooke honge."
"4492","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne bachchon ko isha ke waqt roko; kyunke jinno ka phelna aur uchakna hai."
"4493","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Lehsan khao....; agar main farishte se sargoshi na karta to use khata."
"4494","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khao; meri umar ki qasam, jo baatil dam se khaye us ne baatil khaya; beshak maine haq dam se khaya."
"4495","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khao jo tumhari kaman tumhein lauta de."
"4496","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khao jo ragon ko kaate siwaye daant ke cheer aur nakhun ke kaat ke."
"4497","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne yateem ke maal mein se khao baghair israaf, fazool-kharchi, maal jama karne aur apne maal ko us ke maal se bachane ke."
"4498","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zaitun ka tail khao aur use lagao; kyunke wo mubarak darakht se hai."
"4499","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke naam se us ke gird se khao aur us ke upar ko chhoro; kyunke barkat us ke upar se aati hai."
"4500","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mil kar khao aur alag na ho; kyunke barkat jamaat ke saath hai."
"4501","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mil kar khao aur alag na ho; kyunke aik ka khana do ko kafi hai aur do ka khana teen aur chaar ko kafi hai. Mil kar khao aur alag na ho; kyunke barkat jamaat mein hai."
"4502","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pyale mein us ke kinaron se khao aur us ke darmiyan se na khao; kyunke barkat us ke darmiyan utarti hai."
"4503","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qurbani ka gosht khao aur zakheera karo."
"4504","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke gird se khao aur us ki choti chhor do; us mein barkat di jayegi."
"4505","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khao, piyo, sadqa do aur pehno baghair israaf aur takabbur ke."
"4506","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khao aur piyo; aur tumhein charhti chamakti roshni dhoka na de; pas khao aur piyo yahan tak ke tumhare liye surkhi aarzi ho jaye."
"4507","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use khao; aur tum mein se jo khaye wo is masjid ke qareeb na aaye yahan tak ke us ki boo us se jati rahe, yani lehsan."
"4508","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ke har hisse ko mitti khayegi siwaye dumchi ki haddi ke; usi se paida kiya gaya aur usi se jora jayega."
"4509","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har Musalman par Musalman ka maal, izzat aur khoon haram hai; aadmi ke liye burayi se kafi hai ke wo apne Musalman bhai ko haqeer samjhe."
"4510","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har shakhs apne sadqe ke saaye mein hai yahan tak ke logon ke darmiyan faisla ho jaye."
"4511","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har shakhs us ke liye taiyar kiya gaya hai jis ke liye wo paida kiya gaya."
"4512","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri saari ummat aafiyat wali hai siwaye khule aam karne walon ke; aur khule aam mein se ye hai ke aadmi raat ko amal kare phir subah kare halanke Allah taala ne use chhupaya tha, to wo kahe: Maine kal raat aisa aur aisa kiya; us ka Rab raat ko use chhupata raha aur wo subah Allah ke parde ko us se khol deta hai."
"4513","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri saari ummat jannat mein dakhil hogi siwaye jo inkar kare. Jo meri itaat kare wo jannat mein dakhil hoga aur jo meri nafarmani kare us ne inkar kiya."
"4514","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat ka har rehne wala aag mein apni jagah dekhega to kahega: Agar Allah ne mujhe hidayat na di hoti; pas us ke liye shukr hoga. Aur aag ka har rehne wala jannat mein apni jagah dekhega to kahega: Kaash Allah ne mujhe hidayat di hoti; pas us par hasrat hogi."
"4515","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bani Adam sab khatakar hain, aur khatakaron mein behtareen tauba karne wale hain."
"4516","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bani Adam mein har aik ko shaitan us ke pehlu mein apni ungli se chubhota hai jab wo paida hota hai siwaye Isa Ibn Maryam ke; wo chubhone gaya to parda mein chubhoya."
"4517","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bani Adam mein har aik ko us din shaitan chhuta hai jis din us ki maan use janti hai siwaye Maryam aur un ke bete ke."
"4518","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har do bechne walon mein bea nahi yahan tak ke juda ho jayen siwaye khiyar wali bea ke."
"4519","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har jism jo haram se uga aag us ki zyada haqdar hai."
"4520","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har khutba jis mein tashahhud na ho wo kate hue haath ki tarah hai."
"4521","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har qadam jo tum mein se koi namaz ki taraf uthata hai us se us ke liye neki likhi jati hai aur us se us ki burayi mitayi jati hai."
"4522","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ki har takhleeq achchi hai."
"4523","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har dua roki hui hai yahan tak ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par durood bheja jaye."
"4524","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har gunah hai jise Allah bakhsh de siwaye jo shirk karte hue mara ya jis ne momin ko jaan-boojh kar qatl kiya."
"4525","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Darindon mein har daant wala ka khana haram hai."
"4526","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har nigehban apne rewar ke baare mein sawal kiya jayega."
"4527","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har sabab aur nasab qayamat ke din toot jayega siwaye mere sabab aur nasab ke."
"4528","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein har jor par sadqa hai har din jis mein suraj tuloo ho: do ke darmiyan insaf sadqa hai, aadmi ki us ke janwar par madad ke use us par sawaar karo ya us ke liye us par us ka samaan rakho sadqa hai, achchi baat sadqa hai, har qadam jo namaz ki taraf uthao sadqa hai, raasta dikhana sadqa hai aur raaste se takleef-deh cheez hatana sadqa hai."
"4529","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har nashawar mashroob haram hai."
"4530","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har shart jo Allah taala ki kitab mein nahi wo baatil hai agarche sau shartein hon."
"4531","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har cheez taqdeer se hai yahan tak ke aajizi aur danayi."
"4532","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tehband mein jo kuch takhnon se neeche ho wo aag mein hai."
"4533","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har cheez jo zinda se kaati jaye wo murda hai."
"4534","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har cheez jo Allah ke zikr mein se nahi lahw aur khel hai siwaye chaar ke: mard ka apni biwi se khelna, mard ka apne ghore ko sikhana, mard ka do nishanon ke darmiyan chalna aur mard ka tairna sikhana."
"4535","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har namaz jis mein Surah Fatiha na parhi jaye wo naqis hai."
"4536","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har Arafah mauqif hai, har Mina qurbangah hai, saara Muzdalifa mauqif hai aur Makka ke har raaste raah aur qurbangah hain."
"4537","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saare Arafat mauqif hain aur Urna se unche raho; saara Muzdalifa mauqif hai aur Batn-e-Muhassir se unche raho; Mina ke har raaste qurbangah hain aur Tashreeq ke tamam din qurbani hain."
"4538","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ka har amal barhaya jata hai: neki das guna se saat sau guna tak, Allah jo chahe. Allah azza wa jal ne farmaya: Siwaye roze ke, kyunke wo mere liye hai aur main us ka badla dunga; wo meri wajah se apni khwahish aur khana chhorta hai. Rozedar ke liye do khushiyan hain: iftar ke waqt khushi aur apne Rab se mulaqat ke waqt khushi; aur us ke munh ki boo Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se zyada pakeeza hai."
"4539","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har amal apne wale se toot jata hai jab wo mar jaye siwaye Allah ki raah mein pehra dene wale ke; kyunke us ka amal us ke liye barhaya jata hai aur us par us ka rizq qayamat ke din tak jari rehta hai."
"4540","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har aankh zina-kar hai; aur aurat jab khushbu laga kar majlis par guzre to wo zaniya hai."
"4541","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har bachcha apne aqiqah ke badle girwi hai; us ki taraf se saatwein din zibah kiya jaye, us ka sar mundwaya jaye aur us ka naam rakha jaye."
"4542","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har qarz sadqa hai."
"4543","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har taqseem jo jahiliyyat mein hui wo us par hai jo taqseem hui; aur har taqseem jise Islam ne paya wo Islam ki taqseem par hai."
"4544","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har zakhm jo Musalman Allah taala ki raah mein khaye qayamat ke din us ki halat mein hoga jab zakhmi hua tha: khoon beh raha hoga; rang khoon ka rang aur khushbu mushk ki khushbu."
"4545","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har jo namaz se nasha de wo haram hai."
"4546","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har jo tum ne apne ghar walon se kiya wo un par sadqa hai."
"4547","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nabi ka saara maal sadqa hai siwaye jo unhon ne apne ghar walon ko khilaya aur pehnaya; ham wirasat nahi dete."
"4548","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har nasha-daar khamr hai aur har nashawar haram hai; aur jo nashawar piye us ki namaz chalis subah ghatayi jayegi; phir agar wo tauba kare to Allah us par tauba karega; phir agar wo chauthi baar laute to Allah par haq hai ke use aag walon ki peep teenat-ul-khabal se pilaye. Aur jo use chhote ko pilaye jo apna halal apne haram se nahi pehchanta to Allah par haq hai ke use teenat-ul-khabal se pilaye."
"4549","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har jo apne baap ke baad milaya jaye jis ki taraf wo mansub ho aur us ke baad us ke waris us ka dawa karein, jo laundi mein se ho jis ka wo us din maalik tha jab us se mila tha, wo us se mil gaya jis ne use milaya; aur us ke liye us wirasat mein kuch nahi jo us se pehle taqseem hui; aur jo wirasat us ne payi jo taqseem nahi hui to us ke liye us ka hissa hai. Aur wo nahi milta jab us ka baap jis ki taraf wo mansub ho us ka inkar kare; aur agar wo aisi laundi mein se ho jis ka wo maalik nahi ya aisi aazad aurat mein se ho jis se us ne zina kiya to wo nahi milta na wirasat pata hai; aur agar wo jis ki taraf wo mansub ho us ne us ka dawa kiya to wo zina ka bachcha hai apni maan walon ke liye jo bhi hon, aazad hon ya laundi."
"4550","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har nashawar haram hai."
"4551","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har nashawar haram hai; aur beshak Allah par ehad hai jo nashawar piye ke use aag walon ke paseene teenat-ul-khabal se pilaye."
"4552","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har nashawar haram hai; aur jis se faraq nasha de us mein se hatheli bhar haram hai."
"4553","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har nashawar khamr hai aur har nashawar haram hai; aur jo duniya mein sharab piye aur mare halanke wo us ki aadat rakhta ho aur tauba na kare to wo use aakhirat mein nahi piyega."
"4554","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har tasweer banane wala aag mein hai; us ke liye har tasveer ke badle jo us ne banayi jaan banayi jayegi jo use jahannam mein azaab degi."
"4555","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har maroof sadqa hai."
"4556","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har maroof sadqa hai; aur bhalayi par rehnumayi karne wala karne wale ki tarah hai.. ..."
"4557","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har maroof sadqa hai; aur maroof mein se ye hai ke apne bhai se is haal mein milo ke tumhara chehra us ki taraf khila hua ho aur ke apne dol mein se apne parosi ke bartan mein dalo."
"4558","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har maroof jo tum ne ameer ya faqeer se kiya wo sadqa hai."
"4559","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har bachcha fitrat par paida hota hai yahan tak ke us ki zaban us ki taraf se bole; phir us ke walidain use Yahudi banate hain ya Nasrani ya Majoosi."
"4560","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har bachcha millat par paida hota hai; phir us ke walidain use Yahudi banate hain, Nasrani banate hain aur mushrik banate hain. Kaha gaya: Phir jo us se pehle halak ho jaye? Farmaya: Allah zyada jaanne wala hai jo wo karte thay."
"4561","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har aik ke liye aasan kiya gaya hai jis ke liye wo paida kiya gaya."
"4562","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har mayyat ka amal us par khatm kiya jata hai siwaye jo Allah ki raah mein pehra dete hue mara; kyunke us ka amal us ke liye qayamat ke din tak barhaya jata hai aur wo qabar ke fitne se aman pata hai."
"4563","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har nauha karne wali jhooti hai siwaye Umm Saad ke."
"4564","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har nasab aur susral qayamat ke din toot jayega siwaye mere nasab aur susral ke."
"4565","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bani Adam mein har jaan sardar hai: mard apne ghar walon ka sardar hai aur aurat apne ghar ki sardar hai."
"4566","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har kharch jo banda kharch kare us mein ajr diya jata hai siwaye imaarat ke."
"4567","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har qasam jo Allah ke siwa se khayi jaye shirk hai."
"4568","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum sab Bani Adam ho aur Adam mitti se paida kiye gaye; ya to aik qaum apne baapon par fakhr karna chhoregi ya wo Allah ke nazdeek gubrila keede se zyada haqeer hogi."
"4569","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum sab nigehban ho aur har aik apne rewar ke baare mein sawal kiya jayega: imam nigehban hai aur wo apne rewar ke baare mein sawal kiya jayega; mard apne ghar walon mein nigehban hai aur wo apne rewar ke baare mein sawal kiya jayega; aurat apne shohar ke ghar mein nigehban hai aur wo apne rewar ke baare mein sawal ki jayegi; khadim apne aaqa ke maal mein nigehban hai aur wo apne rewar ke baare mein sawal kiya jayega; mard apne baap ke maal mein nigehban hai aur wo apne rewar ke baare mein sawal kiya jayega. Pas tum sab nigehban ho aur tum sab apne rewar ke baare mein sawal kiye jaoge."
"4570","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum sab jannat mein dakhil hoge siwaye jo Allah par oont ke apne walon par bhadakne ki tarah bhadke."
"4571","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kushadgi ke kalimaat: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi jo burdbar izzat wala hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi jo buland azeem hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi jo saaton aasmanon ka Rab aur izzat wale Arsh ka Rab hai."
"4572","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do kalime zaban par halke, meezan mein bhari, Rehman ko mehboob: Subhan Allah wa bihamdihi, Subhan Allahil Azeem."
"4573","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kitne bikhre baalon wale gard-aalood do kapron wale hain jin ki parwa nahi ki jati; agar wo Allah par qasam khayen to wo use poora kare. Un mein Bara bin Malik hain."
"4574","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Dahdah ke liye jannat mein kitne khajoor ke khoshe latke hue hain."
"4575","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jaise kaante se angoor nahi toda jata aise hi badkaar naik logon ki manzilon par nahi utarte; pas jo raasta chaho chalo; jis raaste chalo ge us walon par utro ge."
"4576","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jaise kaante se angoor nahi toda jata aise hi badkaar naik logon ki manzilon par nahi utarte; aur ye do raaste hain; tum in mein se jo lo ge us tak pahunch jao ge."
"4577","[AI-translation] Hamein jaisa ajr dugna kiya jata hai aise hi ham par aazmaish dugni ki jati hai."
"4578","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mardon mein se bahut kaamil hue aur auraton mein se siwaye Firaun ki biwi Aasiya aur Maryam bint Imran ke koi kaamil nahi hui; aur beshak Ayesha ki fazilat auraton par aisi hai jaise sareed ki fazilat baaqi khane par."
"4579","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya mein aise raho jaise ajnabi ya raasta paar karne wala."
"4580","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Parhezgar bano tum sab se zyada ibadat-guzar hoge; qanaat wale bano tum sab se zyada shukr-guzar hoge; logon ke liye wahi pasand karo jo apne liye pasand karte ho tum momin hoge; apne hamsaye se achchi hamsayagi karo tum Musalman hoge; aur hansna kam karo kyunke zyada hansna dil ko murda kar deta hai."
"4581","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Nabi tha jab Adam rooh aur jism ke darmiyan thay."
"4582","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine tumhein mashroob se mana kiya tha siwaye chamre ke bartan mein; pas har bartan mein piyo siwaye is ke ke nashawar na piyo."
"4583","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine tumhein bartanon se mana kiya tha; pas nabeez banao aur har nashawar se bacho."
"4584","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine tumhein qabron ki ziyarat se mana kiya tha; khabardar un ki ziyarat karo, kyunke wo dil ko narm karti hai, aankh ko aanso deti hai aur aakhirat yaad dilati hai; aur behuda baat na kaho."
"4585","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine tumhein teen se zyada qurbani ke gosht se mana kiya tha taake maal wala us par wusat kare jis ke paas maal nahi; pas khao jo tumhein dikhe, khilao aur zakheera karo."
"4586","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne in mashair par raho; kyunke tum aaj Ibrahim ke wirse mein se wirse par ho."
"4587","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us saff mein raho jo mujh se mili hui ho."
"4588","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara kiya haal hoga jab tum par aise hukmaran hon jo namaz ko us ke waqt se moakkhar karein? Namaz us ke waqt par parho; phir agar use un ke saath pao to parho, kyunke wo tumhare liye nafl hai."
"4589","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara kiya haal hoga jab tum deenar aur dirham hasil na kar sako ge? Allah aur us ke Rasool ki zimma tooti jayegi; Allah zimmi ke dil sakht kar dega aur wo apne haathon mein jo hai rok lenge."
"4590","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara kiya haal hoga jab Ibn Maryam tum mein utrein aur tumhari imamat karein?"
"4591","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara kiya haal hoga jab Ibn Maryam tum mein utrein aur tumhara imam tum mein se ho?"
"4592","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara kiya haal hoga jab soor wala soor munh mein liye, peshani jhukaye, kaan lagaye intezar kare ke use phoonkne ka hukm kab diya jaye aur wo phoonke? Sahaba ne kaha: Ham kiya karein? Farmaya: Kaho: Allah hamein kafi hai aur wo behtareen kaar-saaz hai; ham ne Allah par tawakkul kiya."
"4593","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara kiya haal hoga jab tum par aise hukmaran aayen jo namaz ghair waqt par parhein? Namaz us ke waqt par parho aur apni namaz un ke saath nafl banao."
"4594","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us zamane mein tumhara kiya haal hoga jo qareeb hai ke aaye jab logon ko chhalni se chhana jayega aur logon mein se bhusa baaqi reh jayega jin ke ehad aur amanatein bigar chuki hongi aur wo ikhtilaf karenge aur aise ho jayenge? Aur unhon ne apni ungliyon mein tashbeek ki. Jo tum jante ho use lo aur jo tum na-pasand karte ho use chhor do; apne khaas muamle par tawajjuh do aur aam muamla chhor do."
"4595","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum us shakhs ki khushi ke baare mein kiya kehte ho jis ki oontni us se chhoot jaye jo apni nakeel kheenchti ho banjar zameen mein jahan na khana ho na pani, aur us par us ka khana aur pani ho; phir wo use talash kare aur na paye yahan tak ke us par mushkil ho jaye, phir wo darakht ke tane ke paas se guzre aur us ki nakeel atak jaye aur wo use atki hui paye? Khabardar, Allah ki qasam, Allah apne bande ki tauba se us shakhs ki apni oontni par khushi se zyada khush hota hai."
"4596","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaise, halanke kaha ja chuka?"
"4597","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah us ummat ko kaise paak karega jis ka kamzor apne taqatwar se apna haq baghair larzish ke na le sake?"
"4598","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah us ummat ko kaise paak karega jis mein taqatwar se kamzor ke liye na liya jaye."
"4599","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apna anaaj naapo; kyunke barkat naape hue anaaj mein hai."
"4600","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apna anaaj naapo, tumhare liye us mein barkat di jayegi."
"4601","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kabeera: Allah ke saath shirk, walidain ki nafarmani, jaan ka qatl aur jhooti qasam."
"4602","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kabeera: Allah ke saath shirk, paak-daman par tuhmat, momin jaan ka qatl, larayi ke din bhaagna, yateem ka maal khana, Musalman walidain ki nafarmani aur Baitullah mein ilhad jo zindagi aur maut mein tumhara qibla hai."
"4603","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kabeera: Allah ke saath shirk, Allah ki rehmat se mayoosi aur Allah ki rehmat se na-ummeedi."
"4604","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kabeera: Allah ke saath shirk, jaan ka qatl aur walidain ki nafarmani. Kiya main tumhein sab se bare kabeera ki khabar na dun? Jhooti gawahi."
"4605","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kabeera nau hain: un mein sab se bara Allah ke saath shirk, na-haq jaan ka qatl, sood khana, yateem ka maal khana, paak-daman par tuhmat, larayi ke din bhaagna, walidain ki nafarmani aur Baitullah Haram ko halal samajhna jo zindagi aur maut mein tumhara qibla hai."
"4606","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kabeera saat hain: Allah ke saath shirk, us jaan ka qatl jise Allah ne haram kiya hai magar haq ke saath, paak-daman par tuhmat, larayi se bhaagna, sood khana, yateem ka maal khana aur hijrat ke baad dehat ki taraf laut jana."
"4607","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bara bara."
"4608","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Takabbur haq ka inkar aur logon ko haqeer samajhna hai."
"4609","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Surma taaq hai."
"4610","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Izzat wala jo izzat wale ka beta, jo izzat wale ka beta, jo izzat wale ka beta hai: Yusuf bin Yaqoob bin Ishaq bin Ibrahim."
"4611","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gehray siyah kutta shaitan hai."
"4612","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khumbi mann mein se hai jo Allah taala ne Bani Israel par utara, aur us ka pani aankh ke liye shifa hai."
"4613","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khumbi mann mein se hai aur us ka pani aankh ke liye shifa hai."
"4614","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kausar aik neher hai jo Allah ne mujhe jannat mein di; us ki mitti mushk hai, doodh se zyada safed aur shehed se zyada meethi; us par parinde aate hain jin ki gardanein oonton ki gardanon jaisi hain; use peene wala un se zyada naimat wala hai."
"4615","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kausar jannat mein aik neher hai jis ke kinare sone ke hain aur us ka behna moti aur yaqoot par hai; us ki mitti mushk se zyada khushbudaar, us ka pani shehed se zyada meetha aur barf se zyada safed hai."
"4616","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka aakhri kalaam tha: Namaz namaz; Allah se daro un ke baare mein jinke tumhare dayen haath malik hue."
"4617","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aakhri baat jo unhon ne kahi ye thi ke farmaya: Allah Yahudiyon aur Nasraniyon se lade; unhon ne apne nabiyon ki qabron ko masjidein bana liya. Arab ki zameen mein do deen baaqi na rahein."
"4618","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke nazdeek makhlooq mein sab se na-pasandida jhoot tha."
"4619","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo safed thay goya chandi se dhale hue, ghungrale baalon wale."
"4620","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo safed surkhi-maail thay, bare sar wale،........ palkon ke kinare."
"4621","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo safed thay jin ki safedi surkhi-maail thi; un ki putliyan siyah thin, palkon ke baal ghane thay."
"4622","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo safed khubsurat darmiyane qad ke thay."
"4623","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke nazdeek rangon mein sab se mehboob sabza tha."
"4624","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke nazdeek kapron mein sab se mehboob dhari-daar tha."
"4625","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke nazdeek kapron mein sab se mehboob qamees thi."
"4626","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke nazdeek deen mein sab se mehboob wo tha jis par us ka karne wala mudawamat kare."
"4627","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke nazdeek mashroob mein sab se mehboob meetha thanda tha."
"4628","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke nazdeek maheenon mein sab se mehboob jis ka roza rakhte Shaban tha, phir use Ramazan se milate."
"4629","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke nazdeek shorbe mein sab se mehboob bakri ka dast tha."
"4630","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke nazdeek amal mein sab se mehboob wo tha jis par mudawamat ki jaye agarche thora ho."
"4631","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni hajat ke liye parda karne mein sab se mehboob un ke nazdeek nishana ya khajooron ka jhund tha."
"4632","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo logon mein akhlaq mein sab se achche thay."
"4633","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo logon mein sab se achche thay: sifar aur sab se khubsurat; wo darmiyane qad thay jo lambai ki taraf maail thay, kandhon ke darmiyan kushada faasle wale, rukhsaron mein dheele, baalon mein gehri siyahi wale, aankhon mein surma lagaye hue, palkon ke baal ghane; jab apna qadam rakhte to poore se rakhte, un ke pair mein garha na tha; jab apne kandhon se chadar hatate to goya chandi ki sill thi،.. ..."
"4634","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo logon mein sab se achche, sab se sakhi aur sab se bahadur thay."
"4635","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo chehre mein logon mein sab se achche aur akhlaq mein sab se achche thay; na numayan lambe thay na chhote."
"4636","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo logon par namaz mein sab se halki parhte thay aur apne liye sab se lambi parhte thay."
"4637","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo mukammal namaz mein sab se halki parhte thay."
"4638","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo kisi qaum ke darwaze par aate to darwaze ka saamne se rukh na karte balke us ke dayen ya bayen kone se, aur kehte: Tum par salamti ho, tum par salamti ho."
"4639","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo kisi beemar ke paas aate ya un ke paas laya jata to kehte: Takleef door kar de ae logon ke Rab, shifa de aur tu hi shifa dene wala hai; teri shifa ke siwa koi shifa nahi, aisi shifa jo beemari na chhore."
"4640","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un ke paas khush karne wala muamla aata to kehte: Sab taareef Allah ke liye jis ki naimat se nekiyan mukammal hoti hain; aur jab un ke paas na-pasandeeda muamla aata to kehte: Har haal mein Allah ke liye hamd hai."
"4641","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un ke paas aadmi aata aur us ka naam jo unhein pasand na hota use badal dete."
"4642","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un ke paas maal-e-fai aata to use usi din taqseem kar dete; ghar wale ko do hisse dete aur ghair-shadi-shuda ko aik hissa."
"4643","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un ke paas qaum apne sadqe ke saath aati to kehte: Ae Allah, falan ki aal par durood bhej."
"4644","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un ke paas phal ki pehli paidawar layi jati to use apni aankhon par rakhte phir apne honton par، ... phir use un bachchon ko dete jo un ke paas hote."
"4645","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un ke paas khana laya jata to us ke baare mein puchte ke tohfa hai ya sadqa? Phir agar kaha jata: Sadqa, to apne sahaba se kehte: Khao, aur khud na khate; aur agar kaha jata: Tohfa, to apna haath marte aur un ke saath khate."
"4646","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un ke ghar walon ko bukhar hota to shorbe ka hukm dete aur wo banaya jata; phir unhein hukm dete aur wo peete; aur kehte thay: Wo ghamgeen ke dil ko taqwiyat deta hai aur beemar ke dil se takleef door karta hai jaise tum mein se aik mail ko pani se apne chehre se door karti ho."
"4647","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo apna bichhona pakarte to apna dayen haath apne dayen rukhsar ke neeche rakhte."
"4648","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo apna bichhona pakarte to Kaho ae kafiro parhte yahan tak ke use khatm karte."
"4649","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo raat ko apna bichhona pakarte to kehte: Allah ke naam se maine apna pehlu rakha; ae Allah, mera gunah bakhsh de, mere shaitan ko door kar, mera giraw rakha chhura, mera meezan bhari kar aur mujhe aala majlis mein kar de."
"4650","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo raat ko apna bichhona pakarte to apna haath apne rukhsar ke neeche rakhte phir kehte: Tere naam se ae Allah main jeeta hun aur tere naam se marta hun. Aur jab jaagte to kehte: Sab taareef Allah ke liye jis ne hamein marne ke baad zinda kiya aur usi ki taraf uthna hai."
"4651","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo hajat ka irada karte to door jate."
"4652","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo hajat ka irada karte to apna kapra na uthate yahan tak ke zameen se qareeb ho jate."
"4653","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo apni haaiza biwiyon mein se kisi se milne ka irada karte to use tehband bandhne ka hukm dete phir us se milte."
"4654","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo ehram ka irada karte to umda tareen khushbu lagate jo pate."
"4655","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo kisi par bad-dua ya kisi ke liye dua ka irada karte to ruku ke baad qunoot parhte."
"4656","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo sone ka irada karte to apna dayen haath apne rukhsar ke neeche rakhte phir kehte: Ae Allah, mujhe apne azaab se bacha jis din tu apne bandon ko uthayega, teen baar."
"4657","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo lashkar ko rukhsat karne ka irada karte to kehte: Main Allah ko tumhara deen, tumhari amanat aur tumhare aamaal ke anjaam supurd karta hun."
"4658","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo etikaaf ka irada karte to Fajr parhte phir apne motakif mein dakhil hote."
"4659","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo sone ka irada karte halanke junbi hote to namaz ke wuzu jaisa wuzu karte; aur jab khane ya peene ka irada karte halanke junbi hote to apne haath dhote phir khate aur peete."
"4660","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo sone ka irada karte halanke junbi hote to apni sharmgah dhote aur namaz ke liye wuzu karte."
"4661","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo safar ka irada karte to apni biwiyon ke darmiyan qura dalte; un mein se jis ka teer nikalta use apne saath le jate."
"4662","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo kisi jihad ka irada karte to us ke siwa aur ka ishara karte."
"4663","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo haaiza se kuch chahte to us ki sharmgah par kapra dalte."
"4664","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo naya kapra pehente to use us ke naam se pukarte: qamees, amama ya chadar; phir kehte: Ae Allah, tere liye hamd hai, tune mujhe pehnaya; main tujh se us ki bhalayi aur jis ke liye wo banaya gaya us ki bhalayi ka sawal karta hun, aur teri panah mangta hun us ke shar aur jis ke liye wo banaya gaya us ke shar se."
"4665","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab khabar mein dair mehsoos karte to Tarfa ke sher se misaal dete: Aur tumhare paas khabrein wo lata hai jise tum ne saman nahi diya."
"4666","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo baarish mangte to kehte: Ae Allah, apne bandon aur janwaron ko sairab kar, apni rehmat phela aur apne murda sheher ko zinda kar."
"4667","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo namaz shuru karte to kehte: Paak hai tu Ae Allah aur teri hamd ke saath; tera naam barkat wala hai, teri buzurgi buland hai aur tere siwa koi mabood nahi."
"4668","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo miswak karte to bare ko miswak dete; aur jab peete to dayen wale ko dete."
"4669","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab sardi sakht hoti to namaz jaldi parhte aur jab garmi sakht hoti to thanda karke parhte."
"4670","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab hawa tez hoti to kehte: Ae Allah, phal-daar bana, be-phal na bana."
"4671","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab koi apne sar ki shikayat karta to kehte: Jao pachhne lagwao; aur jab apne pair ki shikayat karta to kehte: Jao use mehndi se rang lo."
"4672","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo beemar hote to Jibreel unhein dam karte aur kehte: Allah ke naam se, wo tumhein har beemari se shifa dega jo shifa deta hai, aur hasad karne wale ke shar se jab wo hasad kare aur har aankh wale ke shar se."
"4673","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo beemar hote to apne upar muawwizatain parh kar phoonkte aur apne haath se ponchhte."
"4674","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab subah karte aur jab shaam karte to kehte: Ham ne Islam ki fitrat, ikhlas ke kalime, hamare Nabi Muhammad ke deen aur hamare baap Ibrahim ki millat par subah ki jo seedhe Musalman thay aur mushrikeen mein se na thay."
"4675","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab unhein apne ghar walon mein se kisi ke jhoot par ittila hoti to us se munh phere rehte yahan tak ke wo tauba kare."
"4676","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab amama bandhte to apna amama apne kandhon ke darmiyan latka dete."
"4677","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kisi qaum ke paas iftar karte to kehte: Tumhare paas rozedar iftar karein, tumhara khana naik log khayen aur tum par farishte utrein."
"4678","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab iftar karte to kehte: Pyas gayi, ragein tar ho gayin aur ajr sabit ho gaya Insha Allah."
"4679","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kisi qaum ke paas iftar karte to kehte: Tumhare paas rozedar iftar karein aur tum par farishte durood bhejein."
"4680","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab surma lagate to taaq lagate aur jab dhuni lete to taaq lete."
"4681","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab khate ya peete to kehte: Sab taareef Allah ke liye jis ne khilaya, pilaya, halaq se utara aur us ka nikalna banaya."
"4682","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab khana khate to apni teen ungliyan chaatte."
"4683","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab khate to un ki ungliyan un ke saamne na barhtin."
"4684","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab dono khatne ki jaghein mil jatin to ghusl karte."
"4685","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un par wahi utarti to us se takleef hoti aur un ka chehra mutaghayyir ho jata."
"4686","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un par wahi utarti to apna sar jhuka lete aur un ke sahaba apne sar jhuka lete; phir jab wo jati rehti to apna sar uthate."
"4687","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wapas hote to mur jate."
"4688","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apni namaz se wapas hote to teen baar istighfar karte phir kehte: Ae Allah, tu salam hai aur tujh se salam hai; tu barkat wala hai ae jalal aur izzat wale."
"4689","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apne bichhone par aate to kehte: Sab taareef Allah ke liye jis ne hamein khilaya, pilaya, kafi hua aur panaah di; kitne hain jin ka na koi kafi hai na panaah dene wala."
"4690","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab log un se baiat karte to unhein sikhate: Jitni taqat rakho."
"4691","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apne sahaba mein se kisi ko apne kisi muamle mein bhejte to kehte: Khushkhabri do aur nafrat na dilao; aasani karo aur sakhti na karo."
"4692","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab unhein kisi shakhs ke baare mein kuch pahunchta to na kehte: Falan ko kiya hua jo kehta hai? Balke kehte: Logon ko kiya hua jo aisa aur aisa kehte hain?"
"4693","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab raat ko ghabra kar uthte to kehte: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi jo aik hai, zabardast hai, aasmanon aur zameen aur jo un ke darmiyan hai ka Rab hai, ghalib bakhshne wala hai."
"4694","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab koi baat kehte to use teen baar dohrate yahan tak ke un se samjhi jaye; aur jab kisi qaum par aate aur unhein salam kehte to unhein teen baar salam kehte."
"4695","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tahajjud parhte to har do rakaaton ke darmiyan salam kehte."
"4696","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wuzu karte to pani ka aik chullu lete aur use apni thodi ke neeche dakhil karte aur us se apni darhi ka khilal karte; aur kehte: Mere Rab ne mujhe aise hukm diya hai."
"4697","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wuzu karte to pani ka aik chullu lete aur us se apni sharmgah par chheente marte."
"4698","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wuzu karte to pani apni kohniyon par pherte."
"4699","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wuzu karte to pani se apni darhi ka khilal karte."
"4700","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wuzu karte to apne pairon ki ungliyon ko apni chhoti ungli se malte."
"4701","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un ke paas khush karne wala muamla aata to Allah taala ke shukr mein sajde mein gir jate."
"4702","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab baithte to apne haathon se goth mar kar baithte."
"4703","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab unhein koi muamla mushkil hota to namaz parhte."
"4704","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab qasam par halaf lete to qasam na tortay yahan tak ke qasam ka kaffara utra."
"4705","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab halaf lete to kehte: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai."
"4706","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kisi qaum se darte to kehte: Ae Allah, ham tujhe un ke seenon mein karte hain aur tere zariye un ke sharon se panah mangte hain."
"4707","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab bait-ul-khala se nikalte to kehte: Teri bakhshish."
"4708","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apne ghar se nikalte to kehte: Allah ke naam se, Allah par tawakkul kiya. Ae Allah, ham teri panah mangte hain is se ke phislein, gumrah hon, zulm karein ya ham par zulm ho, jahalat karein ya ham par jahalat ki jaye."
"4709","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apne ghar se nikalte to kehte: Allah ke naam se; ae Rab, teri panah mangta hun is se ke phislun, gumrah hun, zulm karun ya mujh par zulm ho, jahalat karun ya mujh par jahalat ki jaye."
"4710","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab eid ke din aik raaste se nikalte to doosre se wapas aate."
"4711","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab khutba dete to un ki aankhein surkh ho jatin, un ki aawaz buland ho jati aur un ka ghussa sakht ho jata goya wo lashkar se darane wale hain jo kehte hain: Subah tum par aur shaam tum par."
"4712","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab bait-ul-khala mein dakhil hote to kehte: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun khabees nar aur maada se."
"4713","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aakhri ashray mein dakhil hote to apna tehband kas lete, apni raat zinda karte aur apne ghar walon ko jagate."
"4714","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab bait-ul-khala mein dakhil hote to kehte: Allah ke naam se; ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun khabees nar aur maada se."
"4715","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab masjid mein dakhil hote to kehte: Main Allah Azeem ki, us ke izzat wale chehre ki aur us ki qadeem saltanat ki shaitan mardood se panah mangta hun. Aur farmaya: Jab wo ye kahe to us se saara din mehfooz rehta hai."
"4716","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab masjid mein dakhil hote to kehte: ...... Ae Allah, Muhammad par aur Muhammad ki biwiyon par durood bhej."
"4717","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apne ghar mein dakhil hote to miswak se shuru karte."
"4718","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kisi beemar par ayadat ke liye dakhil hote to kehte: Koi harj nahi, paaki hai Insha Allah."
"4719","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab dakhil hote to kehte: Kiya tumhare paas khana hai? Phir agar kaha jata nahi to kehte: Main rozedar hun."
"4720","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab dua karte to apne aap se shuru karte."
"4721","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab dua karte to apni hatheli ka andaruni hissa apne chehre ki taraf karte."
"4722","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab bakri zibah karte to kehte: Use Khadija ki saheliyon ki taraf bhejo."
"4723","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kisi ka zikr karte aur us ke liye dua karte to apne aap se shuru karte."
"4724","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab qaza-e-hajat ke liye jate to door jate."
"4725","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab baarish dekhte to kehte: Ae Allah, nafa-mand barsa."
"4726","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab chaand dekhte to kehte: Ae Allah, use ham par barkat, iman, salamati aur Islam ke saath tuloo kar; mera aur tumhara Rab Allah hai."
"4727","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab pasandeeda cheez dekhte to kehte: Sab taareef Allah ke liye jis ki naimat se nekiyan mukammal hoti hain; aur jab na-pasandeeda cheez dekhte to kehte: Har haal mein Allah ke liye hamd hai. ... ..."
"4728","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab koi cheez unhein darrati to kehte: Allah Allah mera Rab hai, us ka koi shareek nahi."
"4729","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab dulhe ko mubarakbad dete jab wo nikah karta to kehte: Allah tumhein barkat de, tum par barkat kare aur tum donon ko bhalayi mein jama kare."
"4730","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab subah ki namaz mein ruku se apna sar uthate aakhri rakat mein qunoot parhte."
"4731","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un ka dastarkhwan uthaya jata to kehte: Sab taareef Allah ke liye bahut pakeeza barkat wali hamd; sab taareef Allah ke liye jis ne hamein kafi kiya aur panaah di; na kafi na na-shukri, na alwida na be-niyazi ae hamare Rab."
"4732","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab ruku karte to apni peeth barabar karte yahan tak ke agar us par pani dala jata to thehar jata."
"4733","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab ruku karte to apni ungliyan khol lete aur jab sajda karte to apni ungliyan mila lete."
"4734","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab ruku karte to kehte: Paak hai mera azeem Rab aur us ki hamd ke saath, teen baar; aur jab sajda karte to kehte: Paak hai mera buland Rab aur us ki hamd ke saath, teen baar."
"4735","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab jamron ko marte to un ki taraf jate aur wapas aate paidal chalte."
"4736","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Jamra-tul-Aqaba ko marte to guzar jate aur na theharte."
"4737","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah se mangte to apni hatheliyon ka andaruni hissa us ki taraf karte. ... ..."
"4738","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab sajda karte to itna khul jate yahan tak ke un ki baghlon ki safedi dikhti."
"4739","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab khush hote to un ka chehra aise chamakta goya chand ka tukra hai."
"4740","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab salam kehte to utni dair na baithte magar jitni mein kehte: Ae Allah, tu salam hai aur tujh se salam hai; tu barkat wala hai ae jalal aur izzat wale."
"4741","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab muazzin ko sunte to waisa kehte jaisa wo kehta yahan tak ke jab wo pahunche: Aao namaz ki taraf, aao kamyabi ki taraf, to kehte: Allah ke siwa na taqat na quwwat."
"4742","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab muazzin ko shahadat kehte sunte to kehte: Aur main aur main."
"4743","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab bura naam sunte to use us se behtar ki taraf badal dete."
"4744","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab peete to teen saans lete aur kehte: Ye zyada khushgawar, hazm-daar aur sehat-mand hai."
"4745","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mimbar par charhte to salam kehte."
"4746","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab subah ki namaz parhte to ahle Madina apne bartanon sameet un ke paas aate jin mein pani hota; phir koi bartan nahi laya jata magar us mein apna haath dubote."
"4747","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab subah ki namaz parhte to apne musalle mein baithte yahan tak ke suraj tuloo ho jata."
"4748","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab safar mein subah ki namaz parhte to apni sawari se thora aage barhte."
"4749","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Fajr ki do rakatein parhte to apne dayen pehlu par let-te."
"4750","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz parhte to use sabit rakhte."
"4751","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Baitullah ka tawaf karte to har tawaf mein Hajr aur Rukn ko chhute."
"4752","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab raat guzarte aur raat baaqi hoti to apne dayen par takiya lagate; aur jab subah se pehle raat guzarte to apna sar apni dayen hatheli par rakhte aur apni kohni khari karte."
"4753","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab hawa tez chalti to kehte: Ae Allah, main tujh se us ki bhalayi, jo us mein hai us ki bhalayi aur jis ke saath wo bheji gayi us ki bhalayi ka sawal karta hun; aur teri panah mangta hun us ke shar, jo us mein hai us ke shar aur jis ke saath wo bheji gayi us ke shar se."
"4754","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab chheenkte to Allah ki hamd karte to un se kaha jata: Allah tum par rehem kare; to kehte: Allah tumhein hidayat de aur tumhara haal durust kare."
"4755","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab chheenkte to apna haath ya kapra apne munh par rakhte aur us se apni aawaz dheemi karte."
"4756","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab koi amal karte to use sabit rakhte."
"4757","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab jihad karte to kehte: Ae Allah, tu mera baazu hai aur tu mera madadgar hai; tere zariye phirta hun, tere zariye hamla karta hun aur tere zariye ladta hun."
"4758","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab ghussa hote to un ke rukhsar surkh ho jate."
"4759","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Zuhr se pehle chaar choot jatin to unhein.... Zuhr ke baad parhte."
"4760","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mayyat dafn karne se farigh hote to us par khare hote aur kehte: Apne bhai ke liye Allah se bakhshish mango aur us ke liye sabat mango; kyunke ab us se sawal ho raha hai."
"4761","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz ke liye khare hote to apne haath phaila kar uthate."
"4762","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mimbar par khare hote to un ke sahaba apne chehre un ki taraf karte."
"4763","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab raat ko namaz ke liye uthte to apni namaz do halki rakaaton se shuru karte."
"4764","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab raat ko uthte to miswak se apna munh saaf karte."
"4765","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab safar se aate to apne ghar walon ke bachche un se milte."
"4766","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab parhte: Apne buland Rab ke naam ki tasbeeh karo, to kehte: Paak hai mera buland Rab."
"4767","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab raat ko parhte to kabhi buland karte aur kabhi past karte."
"4768","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un ke paas khana laya jata to kehte: Allah ke naam se; phir jab farigh hote to kehte: Ae Allah, tune khilaya, pilaya, ghani kiya, qanaat di, hidayat di aur muntakhab kiya; ae Allah, pas tere liye hamd hai jo tune ata kiya."
"4769","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab jihad, hajj ya umrah se wapas aate to zameen ki har bulandi par takbeer kehte, teen takbeerein; phir kehte: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi jo tanha hai us ka koi shareek nahi; usi ka mulk hai aur usi ke liye hamd hai aur wo har cheez par qaadir hai. Lautne wale, tauba karne wale, ibadat karne wale, sajda karne wale, apne Rab ki hamd karne wale; Allah ne apna wada sach kiya, apne bande ki madad ki aur tanha girohon ko shikast di."
"4770","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab taaza khajoor hoti to taaza khajoor ke siwa iftar na karte; aur jab taaza khajoor na hoti to khushk khajoor ke siwa iftar na karte."
"4771","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab ruku ya sajde mein hote to kehte: Paak hai tu aur teri hamd ke saath; main tujh se bakhshish mangta hun aur teri taraf tauba karta hun."
"4772","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab rozedar hote to aadmi ko hukm dete aur wo kisi cheez par charhta; phir jab wo kehta ke suraj doob gaya to iftar karte."
"4773","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apni namaz ke taaq mein hote to na uthte yahan tak ke barabar baith jate."
"4774","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Tarwiya se aik din pehle hote to logon ko khutba dete aur unhein un ke manasik batate."
"4775","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab muqeem hote to Ramazan ke aakhri ashray ka etikaaf karte; aur jab safar karte to agle saal bees din ka etikaaf karte."
"4776","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab eid ka din hota to raasta badalte."
"4777","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab unhein koi muamla ghamgeen karta to kehte: Ae zinda ae qayyum, teri rehmat se madad mangta hun."
"4778","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab koi cheez na-pasand karte to wo un ke chehre mein dikhti."
"4779","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab qamees pehente to dayen se shuru karte."
"4780","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un ke sahaba mein se koi un se milta aur un ke saath khara hota to us ke saath khare hote aur na hat-te yahan tak ke wo shakhs un se hatne wala hota. Aur jab un ke sahaba mein se koi un se milta aur un ka haath pakarta to use apna haath dete aur apna haath us se na kheench-te yahan tak ke wo shakhs apna haath kheenchne wala hota. Aur jab apne sahaba mein se kisi se milte aur wo un ka kaan pakarta to use apna kaan dete phir use na hata-te yahan tak ke wo shakhs use hatane wala hota."
"4781","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un ke sahaba mein se koi aadmi un se milta to use chhute aur us ke liye dua karte."
"4782","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab darr ki aayat par guzarte to panah mangte, jab rehmat ki aayat par guzarte to mangte aur jab aisi aayat par guzarte jis mein Allah ki pakeezgi ho to tasbeeh karte."
"4783","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un ke ghar walon mein se koi beemar hota to us par muawwizatain parh kar phoonkte."
"4784","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab chalte to tez chalte."
"4785","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab chalte to goya sahara lete."
"4786","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab chalte to mur kar na dekhte."
"4787","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab chalte to un ke sahaba un ke aage chalte aur un ki peeth farishton ke liye chhor dete."
"4788","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab raat ko sote ya beemar hote to din mein baarah rakatein parhte."
"4789","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab sote to phoonk marte."
"4790","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab sote to apna dayen haath apne rukhsar ke neeche rakhte aur kehte: Ae Allah, mujhe apne azaab se bacha jis din tu apne bandon ko uthayega."
"4791","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab unhein fikr ya gham pahunchta to kehte: Ae zinda ae qayyum, teri rehmat se madad mangta hun."
"4792","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab un par wahi utarti to us se bhari ho jate aur un ki peshani se paseena moti ki tarah beh niklta agarche sardi mein hote."
"4793","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kisi manzil par utarte to Zuhr parhe baghair kooch na karte."
"4794","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apne ghar walon mein se kisi se milte aur uthne mein susti karte to apna haath deewar par marte aur tayammum karte."
"4795","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kisi shakhs ko rukhsat karte to us ka haath pakarte aur use na chhorte yahan tak ke wo shakhs apna haath chhorne wala hota; aur kehte: Main Allah ko tumhara deen, tumhari amanat aur tumhare amal ke anjaam supurd karta hun."
"4796","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mayyat ko us ki lahad mein rakhte to kehte: Allah ke naam se, Allah ke saath, Allah ki raah mein aur Allah ke Rasool ki millat par."
"4797","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo bachchon aur ghar walon par logon mein sab se zyada rehem karne wale thay."
"4798","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo roshan rang wale thay goya un ka paseena moti tha; jab chalte to jhukte."
"4799","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo parday mein kunwari se zyada haya-daar thay."
"4800","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ki aksar qasmein thin: Nahi, dilon ko pherne wale ki qasam."
"4801","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ki aksar dua thi: Ae dilon ko pherne wale, mere dil ko apne deen par sabit rakh. To un se is ke baare mein pucha gaya? Farmaya: Koi insaan nahi magar us ka dil Allah ki ungliyon mein se do ungliyon ke darmiyan hai; jis ko chahe qayam rakhe aur jis ko chahe tehra kar de."
"4802","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo aksar dua jo karte thay: Ae hamare Rab, hamein duniya mein bhalayi de aur aakhirat mein bhalayi de aur hamein aag ke azaab se bacha."
"4803","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ka aksar roza hafta aur itwar ka tha; aur kehte: Ye donon mushrikeen ke eid ke din hain; pas main chahta hun ke un ki mukhalifat karun."
"4804","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo aksar peer aur jumeraat ka roza rakhte; to un se pucha gaya? Farmaya: Aamaal har peer aur jumeraat ko pesh kiye jate hain; pas har Musalman ko bakhsh diya jata hai siwaye qata-talluq karne walon ke; to kehta hai: Un donon ko moakkhar karo."
"4805","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ka darwaza nakhunon se khatkhataya jata tha."
"4806","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ki aankhein soti thin aur un ka dil nahi sota tha."
"4807","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ki peeth mein nabuwat ki muhar ubhra hua gosht ka tukra thi."
"4808","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ki muhar surkh dana thi jo kabootar ke ande jaisi thi."
"4809","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ki angoothi chandi ki thi jis ka nageena usi mein se tha."
"4810","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ki angoothi waraq ki thi aur us ka nageena Habshi tha."
"4811","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ka akhlaq Quran tha."
"4812","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ka jhanda siyah tha aur alam safed tha."
"4813","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo qaum mein darmiyane qad thay; na numayan lambe thay na chhote; roshan rang wale; na intehayi safed thay na gandumi; na ghungrale baalon wale thay na seedhe."
"4814","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ghar walon par rehem karne wale thay."
"4815","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo rehem karne wale thay; un ke paas jo bhi aata use wada dete aur us ke liye poora karte agar un ke paas hota."
"4816","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo bazuaon mein bhare hue, kandhon ke darmiyan kushada faasle wale, aankhon ki palkon ke baal ghane thay."
"4817","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke baal jumma se neeche aur wafra se upar thay."
"4818","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke safed baal taqreeban bees baal thay."
"4819","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo sar, haathon aur pairon mein bhare hue thay."
"4820","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo bare sar aur bari darhi wale thay."
"4821","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo khule munh, aankhon mein surkhi-maail safedi wale aur eriyon mein bareek thay."
"4822","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo lambi khamoshi wale, kam hansne wale thay."
"4823","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ki guftagu mein thehrao tha."
"4824","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo bahut paseene wale thay."
"4825","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo darhi ke baalon mein ghane thay."
"4826","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ki guftagu wazeh guftagu thi jise har sunne wala samajhta tha."
"4827","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ki jooti mein do tasmay thay."
"4828","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke paas pyala tha jis ke chaar halqe thay."
"4829","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke paas gadha tha jis ka naam Ufair tha."
"4830","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke paas kapra tha jis se wuzu ke baad ponchhte thay."
"4831","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke paas dabiya thi jis se khushbu lagate thay."
"4832","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke paas lakri ka pyala tha jo bistar ke neeche tha jis mein raat ko peshaab karte thay."
"4833","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke paas pyala tha jise Gharra kaha jata tha jise chaar aadmi uthate thay."
"4834","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke do muazzin thay: Bilal aur Ibn Umm Maktoom andhe."
"4835","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke paas wars aur zaafran se rangi hui chadar thi jis mein wo apni biwiyon par phirte thay; phir jab is ki raat hoti to use pani se geela karti, jab is ki raat hoti to use pani se geela karti aur jab is ki raat hoti to use pani se geela karti."
"4836","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo khadim se kehte mein se tha: Tumhein koi hajat hai?"
"4837","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ka chehra suraj aur chand jaisa tha aur gol tha."
"4838","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ka takiya jis par raat ko sote thay chamre ka tha jis mein chhaal bhari hui thi."
"4839","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke liye donon eidon mein azaan nahi hoti thi."
"4840","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo tek laga kar na khate aur un ki eri par do aadmi na chalte."
"4841","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo bad-shaguni na lete lekin naik-faali lete."
"4842","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raat ko jab bhi uthte to miswak apne munh par pherte."
"4843","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ghusl ke baad wuzu na karte."
"4844","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo raddi khajoor mein se utni na pate jo un ka pait bhare."
"4845","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo Fitr ke din na nikalte yahan tak ke kha lete, aur Qurbani ke din na khate yahan tak ke zibah kar lete."
"4846","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo kal ke liye kuch zakheera na karte."
"4847","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo Zuhr se pehle chaar aur subah se pehle do na chhorte."
