"4990","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo baat teen baar dohrate taake un se samjhi jaye."
"4991","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo saa se ghusl karte aur mudd se wuzu karte."
"4992","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo aur un ki biwiyon mein se aik aurat aik bartan se ghusl karte."
"4993","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo apni pakhana ki jagah teen baar dhote."
"4994","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo bura naam badal dete."
"4995","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo namaz se pehle taaza khajooron par iftar karte; phir agar taaza khajoorein na hotin to khushk khajooron par; phir agar khushk khajoorein na hotin to pani ke chand ghoont peete."
"4996","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo apna kapra dekhte, apni bakri dohte aur apne aap ki khidmat karte."
"4997","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo apni kisi biwi ka bosa lete phir namaz parhte aur wuzu na karte."
"4998","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo bosa lete halanke rozedar hote."
"4999","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo tohfa qabool karte aur us ka badla dete."
"5000","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo apni qiraat aayat aayat kar ke kaatte: Sab taareef Allah ke liye jo jahano ka Rab hai, phir theharte; Nihayat meherban rehem wala, phir theharte."
"5001","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo un mein se aik se itab ke waqt kehte: Us ka kiya bana, us ki peshani mitti-aalood ho?"
"5002","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo khare hote jab cheekhne wale ko sunte."
"5003","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo raat ko qayam karte yahan tak ke un ke qadam phat jate."
"5004","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo Fitr ke din takbeer kehte jab se apne ghar se nikalte yahan tak ke eidgah aate."
"5005","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo zikr kasrat se karte, behuda-goi kam karte, namaz lambi karte aur khutba chhota karte; aur bewa, miskeen aur ghulam ke saath chalne se aar ya takabbur na karte yahan tak ke us ki hajat poori kar dete."
"5006","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ghoron mein shikaal ko na-pasand karte."
"5007","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo sawalat ko na-pasand karte aur unhein aeb samajhte; phir jab Abu Razin un se sawal karte to unhein jawab dete aur unhein pasand aata."
"5008","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo na-pasand karte ke khane ke upar se liya jaye."
"5009","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo na-pasand karte ke koi un ki eri par chale, lekin dayen aur bayen."
"5010","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo baghair baalon wali jootiyan pehente aur apni darhi ko wars aur zaafran se peela karte."
"5011","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo namaz mein dayen bayen dekhte aur apni gardan apni peeth ke peeche na morhte."
"5012","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo apna seena aur chehra Multazam se lagate."
"5013","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo Quran mein apni aawaz kheench kar parhte."
"5014","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo bachchon par guzarte to unhein salam kehte."
"5015","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo auraton par guzarte to unhein salam kehte."
"5016","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo aise chalte jo chalne mein maloom hota ke wo aajiz ya sust nahi."
"5017","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo raat ke awwal mein sote aur aakhir ko zinda karte."
"5018","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo sote yahan tak ke kharrate lete phir uthte aur namaz parhte aur wuzu na karte."
"5019","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo sote halanke junbi hote aur pani na chhute."
"5020","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo apni qurbani eidgah mein zibah karte."
"5021","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo namaz se apne dayen taraf se wapas hote."
"5022","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo dam mein phoonkte."
"5023","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo oont par witr parhte."
"5024","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo raat ke awwal, darmiyan aur aakhir mein witr parhte."
"5025","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo Zainab bint Umm Salama se khelte aur kehte: Ae Zuwaineb, ae Zuwaineb, baar baar."
